FWR Group Pty Ltd provides sustainability consulting and education services for all facets of the emerging sustainable development sector.

FWR Group Pty Ltd (FWR) specialises in sustainability consulting and education to business and government:

• Sustainability Policy, Strategic Planning, Indicators, and monitoring and reporting;
• Sustainable urban development, including planning code requirements and GreenStar reporting;
• The development and implementation of Education for Sustainability (EfS) training programs and eLearning;
• Corporate Social Responsibility;
• Strategic Policy and Systems Development; and,
• The acceleration of sustainable development via the brokerage of niche energy, water, and resource efficient, technologies, and their application in the urban development sector.

We source, consult on, and manage all aspects of sustainable development, including sustainable business and development, and FWR Group Pty Ltd designs and implements programs in Education for Sustainabilty (EfS) for local business aiming to develop a stronger Triple Bottom Line.

